{"id":"65a13edc5962f3bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf2-no-hole-interval.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 No Hole Interval","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-no-hole-interval — ZFC Pcf2 No Hole Interval","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-no-hole-interval","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-no-hole-interval"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-no-hole-interval — ZFC Pcf2 No Hole Interval","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-no-hole-interval"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-no-hole-interval</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-no-hole-interval — ZFC Pcf2 No Hole Interval"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"13b44f8137f7b9f8\" href=\"?note=13b44f8137f7b9f8\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (candidate progressive set of regular cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu\\in V\\)</span> (interval cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S\\)</span> (possible-cofinality predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"13b44f8137f7b9f8\" href=\"?note=13b44f8137f7b9f8\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2NoHoleInterval}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2NoHoleInterval}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}no\\text{-}hole\\text{-}interval} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2NoHoleInterval}_S(A,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S(A,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S(A,\\lambda)\\land\\forall\\mu\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\mu\\land\\mu\\leq\\lambda)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S(A,\\mu)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}no\\text{-}hole\\text{-}interval} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2NoHoleInterval}_S(A,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S(A,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S(A,\\lambda)\\land\\forall\\mu\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\mu\\land\\mu\\leq\\lambda)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S(A,\\mu)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The endpoints are themselves required to lie in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span>; the final conjunct then states that no regular cardinal between them is omitted.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"13b44f8137f7b9f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$ (regular-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"13b44f8137f7b9f8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S$ (possible-cofinality predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2NoHoleInterval}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}no\\text{-}hole\